    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "noticing the light isn't gonna change the fact that the loop is absolute. it's like trying to put a band-aid on a void. everything i do just feeds the machine. even my \"moments of presence\" are just more time spent being a unit of labor. it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to exit it entirely. otherwise, i'm just waiting to die of old age in this same fucking aisle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
